Z||000000||formula2||07-30-2001||10:34 PM||||Roads are so bad here in Quebec..And great in Vermont..So I will drive my 86 GT to the  "Antique&Classic Car Meet". August 10-11-12..<BR>I hope to see some good looking Fiero..<P> <A HREF="http://www.gostowe.com/activities/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gostowe.com/activities/index.html</A> ||||reg||2
Z||000001||Robert||07-31-2001||12:07 AM||||I saw that show a couple of years ago.  My brother-in-law is a sign maker in Stowe <A HREF="http://www.signschool.com/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.signschool.com/index.htm</A>  so we go back there every few years.  We are headed back again this year in early October, gotta see those leaves.<BR>Well anyway, I don’t remember seeing any Fiero’s at the last show, but I did see everything from 1900’s cars, Sherman tanks, and fire engines of all years, also lots and lots of 50’s cars.  They take over the whole town (not a hard thing to do), and put on a loooooooog parade.  There was a big car show in a field just below Ben & Jerry’s.<BR>I know you’ll enjoy the view of all the cars, I just don’t think you’ll see many Fiero’s.<BR>Robert<BR><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF">   <P> "By the time you die, you should be so used to <BR>paying taxes that it would be almost second nature <BR>to you."||||reg||10
